<body>
    <h1>IPL =E2=80=93 Flottenserver Integration testing</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <p local-id=3D"3a9add1f8c76">As part of the end-to-end integration =
testing phase, IPL was integrated with the Flottenserver mock services. The=
 following test scenarios were carried out to validate the interface connec=
tivity, data flow, and communication between the systems, ensuring that inf=
ormation is exchanged, processed, and synchronized as expected within the i=
ntegrated environment.</p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"1513" data-layout=3D"center" data-local-id=3D"91=
